.input|markdown/1.2
.# Verify that escaped special characters are parsed as text
.#-----------------------------------------------------
text \{{info}}foo\{{/info}} {x}  
see \[\[Page]] and a\_b \*c\* \~d\~ x\^2\^ !\[\[img.png]] wow!  
\# not heading  
10\. not list  
a \<b>c\</b> d \&amp; e < f & g  
\> not quote  
\: not definition  
\+ not list  
\- not list  
\=== not heading  
\~\~\~ not code  
back\\slash \\\* <code>a\_b</code> {{code}}a_b{{/code}}
.#-----------------------------------------------------
